OL,3,GNEWSABoy and woman arrested after
OL,4,Arapist flees country
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy and a 36-year-old
OL,7,Fwoman have been arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof helping a convicted child rapist
OL,9,Fflee the country.
OL,11,FMudasar Hussain, 37, from Rotherham,
OL,12,Fwas sentenced to 23 years in prison in
OL,13,Fhis absence at Sheffield Crown Court on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FThe teenager, from Sheffield, and the
OL,17,Fwoman, from Rotherham, were arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of perverting the course of
OL,19,Fjustice in relation to his escape and
OL,20,Fwere being held for questioning, the
OL,21,FNational Crime Agency (NCA) said.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
